MOSS Image reference images, for edit LoRAs from github.com/Chenkin-x/Moss-Image-Edit.

MOSSImageFixed runs the reference tokens through every block once at timestep 0 (they attend
only to each other) and outputs each block's keys and values; MOSSImage concatenates them to
its own. The Kontext modifier encodes references for .mossImage like FLUX.2, and the negative
branch doesn't skip block 22 when editing.

